{{!
    This one exists because a deletion can be cancelled without anyone deciding to —
    signing in is enough. Someone who did want it to go ahead needs to find that out.
}}
<h2>Deletion cancelled</h2>

<p>Hi {{UserName}},</p>

{{#IsHousehold}}
<p>The deletion of <strong>{{HouseholdName}}</strong>, requested on {{RequestedOn}}, has been cancelled. Nothing has been deleted and the household is back to normal.</p>
{{/IsHousehold}}
{{^IsHousehold}}
<p>The deletion of your account, requested on {{RequestedOn}}, has been cancelled. Nothing has been deleted and your account is back to normal.</p>
{{/IsHousehold}}

<p>Signing in cancels a scheduled deletion, so this may have happened simply because you opened the app.</p>

<p><strong>If you still want to go ahead</strong>, request deletion again from Security in your profile.</p>
